# ClearDue rules (Roo Code) — agent-skills workflow, speckit retired

SpecKit / `.specify` is RETIRED. The single workflow is addyosmani/agent-skills
(25 skills + hallmark). Skills live in `.roo-code/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`
(symlinks → `../../.agents/skills/<name>`); canonical source is
`.agents/skills/` + `skills-lock.json`. Never edit a skill in place — run
`npx skills update` then `./scripts/sync-agent-skills.sh`.

Lifecycle: spec-driven-development → planning-and-task-breakdown →
incremental-implementation + test-driven-development →
debugging-and-error-recovery → code-review-and-quality → shipping-and-launch.
Router: using-agent-skills. Clarify: interview-me / idea-refine.

ClearDue non-negotiables: human approval gate (sweep queues `pending_approval`, NOTHING sends without Approve + Send), 1 credit/invoice (free 3 on signup), secrets never committed, verify with `npx tsc --noEmit` + `npm run build`.
